                                                "sense_id": "8b2d5243-5b7d-3142-bb8e-547f22e7846d",
                                                "text": "Scapegoating an impotent government (running around to clean up the messes made by its business friends) arises from bad faith, from a continuing hostility to the Nanny State that nevertheless goes alongside a refusal to accept the consequences of the sidelining of government in global capitalism […]"
